---
_label: "Beatlix"
_icon: icon.music
description: "A shared space for group activities."
---

Beatlix is a shared group activity platform. You can chat, share your screen, listen to music together, or just hang out, much like Discord but with a focus on shared real-time experiences. Audio, video, and screen sharing are streamed peer-to-peer via WebRTC and never touch the server. The server only stores the minimum needed for identity: registered user accounts and group (jam) IDs. Messages are intended to follow the same model, routed peer-to-peer where possible with no central storage.

## Features

- Chat and hang out with others in real time
- Share your screen or browser tab via WebRTC
- Search and play music from YouTube and other sources
- Sync playback across participants with drift correction

## Getting Started

Beatlix is currently in early development. Follow the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/Huy-DNA/beatlix) for updates.
